tart":"2106-02-27T21:49:56.039Z","end":"2106-07-27T01:16:56.039Z"},{"lord":"Rahu","start":"2106-07-27T01:16:56.039Z","end":"2107-08-14T13:34:56.039Z"},{"lord":"Jupiter","start":"2107-08-14T13:34:56.039Z","end":"2108-07-20T11:10:56.039Z"},{"lord":"Saturn","start":"2108-07-20T11:10:56.039Z","end":"2109-08-29T06:49:56.039Z"},{"lord":"Mercury","start":"2109-08-29T06:49:56.039Z","end":"2110-08-26T11:46:56.039Z"},{"lord":"Ketu","start":"2110-08-26T11:46:56.039Z","end":"2111-01-22T15:13:56.039Z"},{"lord":"Venus","start":"2111-01-22T15:13:56.039Z","end":"2112-03-23T18:13:56.039Z"},{"lord":"Sun","start":"2112-03-23T18:13:56.039Z","end":"2112-07-29T14:19:56.039Z"},{"lord":"Moon","start":"2112-07-29T14:19:56.039Z","end":"2113-02-27T15:49:56.039Z"}]}]}}},"cached":false},"reading_en":{"reading":{"summary":"You meet life head-on. Your rising sign (lagna) is Mesha, which gives a direct, quick-starting nature, while your Moon in Kumbha makes you think for yourself and care about the wider group. Your birth star is Shatabhisha. Right now you are near the end of a long Jupiter period, with a steadier, harder-working Saturn period beginning in early 2027.","areas":[{"key":"nature","text":"You come across as confident and ready to act, but underneath you are more thoughtful and independent than people first assume. You need room to do things your own way.","why":"Mesha lagna ruled by Mars, with the Sun, Moon and Mars together in Kumbha in your 11th house."},{"key":"career","text":"Work that needs planning, clear communication and steady responsibility suits you. You tend to rise through networks and through people who trust your judgement.","why":"Mercury sits in your 10th house of career, and its lord Saturn links work with distant places and behind-the-scenes effort."},{"key":"money","text":"Income tends to come through groups, friends and large organisations rather than alone. You can spend freely on comfort, so a simple savings habit helps.","why":"Three grahas in the 11th house of gains; Venus, lord of the 2nd house of money, is strong but in the 12th house of expenses."},{"key":"relationships","text":"You look for a partner who is graceful and fair-minded, and you bring loyalty and generosity. The relationship does best when both of you keep some private time.","why":"The 7th house is Tula; its lord Venus is exalted in Meena in the 12th house."},{"key":"family","text":"Home matters to you as a place to recharge, and friends often feel like family.","why":"The Moon, lord of your 4th house, sits in the 11th house of friends."},{"key":"wellbeing","text":"You have plenty of drive, so regular rest matters more than extra effort. A steady sleep routine suits you.","why":"Lagna lord Mars with the Moon; several grahas in the 12th house of rest."},{"key":"now","text":"You are in Jupiter's period until February 2027, a time of growth and learning. After that a long Saturn period begins, which rewards patience and steady work.","why":"Vimshottari dasha counted from your birth star, Shatabhisha."}],"source":"ai","language":"en"}},"reading_hi":{"reading":{"summary":"आप जीवन का सामना सीधे करते हैं। आपका लग्न (जन्म के समय उदय होने वाली राशि) मेष है, जो तेज़ और स्पष्ट स्वभाव देता है, और कुंभ का चंद्रमा आपको स्वतंत्र सोच देता है। आपका जन्म नक्षत्र शतभिषा है। अभी गुरु की दशा चल रही है, जो फ़रवरी 2027 तक रहेगी।","areas":[{"key":"nature","text":"आप आत्मविश्वासी दिखते हैं, पर भीतर से विचारशील और स्वतंत्र हैं।","why":"मेष लग्न, और सूर्य, चंद्र व मंगल ग्यारहवें भाव में कुंभ में।"},{"key":"career","text":"योजना, संवाद और ज़िम्मेदारी वाला काम आपको जँचता है।","why":"बुध दसवें भाव में है।"},{"key":"money","text":"आय अक्सर समूहों और मित्रों के ज़रिए आती है।","why":"ग्यारहवें भाव में तीन ग्रह।"},{"key":"now","text":"गुरु की दशा फ़रवरी 2027 तक है; उसके बाद शनि की दशा शुरू होगी।","why":"विंशोत्तरी दशा, जन्म नक्षत्र शतभिषा से।"}],"source":"ai","language":"hi"}},"reading_rules":{"reading":{"summary":"Your rising sign (lagna) is Mesha, your Moon sign is Kumbha and your birth star is Shatabhisha. Each note below says what one part of the chart shows and where it comes from.","areas":[{"key":"nature","text":"With Mesha (Aries) rising, you tend to meet life head-on: quick to start, direct, and happiest when you are leading the way. Your Moon in Kumbha gives a cool, independent mind that needs space, ideas and friendship.","why":"Lagna (rising sign) Mesha; Moon in Kumbha, Shatabhisha nakshatra."},{"key":"career","text":"Your house of career is Makara, ruled by Saturn. Saturn sits in your house of expenses, rest, solitude and foreign places, so career is tied to those themes in your life. Mercury sits in this house and colours it directly.","why":"House 10 counted from the lagna: Makara, lord Saturn in house 12; occupied by Mercury."},{"key":"money","text":"Your house of money is Vrishabha, ruled by Venus. Venus sits in your house of expenses, rest, solitude and foreign places, so money is tied to those themes in your life. Venus is strong there (exalted), which supports this side of life.","why":"House 2 counted from the lagna: Vrishabha, lord Venus in house 12."},{"key":"relationships","text":"Your house of marriage and partnership is Tula, ruled by Venus. Venus sits in your house of expenses, rest, solitude and foreign places, so marriage and partnership is tied to those themes in your life. Venus is strong there (exalted), which supports this side of life.","why":"House 7 counted from the lagna: Tula, lord Venus in house 12."},{"key":"family","text":"Your house of home and family is Karka, ruled by Moon. Moon sits in your house of gains, income and friends, so home and family is tied to those themes in your life.","why":"House 4 counted from the lagna: Karka, lord Moon in house 11."},{"key":"now","text":"You are in the Jupiter mahadasha (a major period of life) until February 2027, with the Rahu sub-period running until February 2027. Jupiter's period favours growth, learning, guidance, family and a widening of opportunity.","why":"Vimshottari dasha counted from the Moon's nakshatra at birth (Shatabhisha)."}],"source":"rules","language":"en"}},"today_en":{"date":"2026-11-26","profile":{"id":"11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111","name":"Sample Person"},"day":{"date":"2026-11-26","engineVersion":"0.2.0","timeKnown":true,"tone":"steady","moon":{"rashi":"Vrishabha","nakshatra":"Mrigashira","houseFromMoon":4,"houseFromLagna":2,"chandraBala":"weak"},"tara":{"count":9,"name":"Parama Mitra","meaning":"best friend","quality":"good"},"theme":{"house":2,"basis":"lagna","topics":"money, speech and family","title":"Money and what you value","focus":["Finances","Food and comfort","Family talk"]},"dayLord":"Jupiter","dayLordIsDashaLord":true,"dasha":{"maha":"Jupiter","mahaStart":"2011-02-27T03:49:56.039Z","mahaEnd":"2027-02-27T03:49:56.039Z","antar":"Rahu","antarStart":"2024-10-03T13:25:56.039Z","antarEnd":"2027-02-27T03:49:56.039Z"},"saturn":{"houseFromMoon":2,"phase":"Sade Sati, last phase","note":"Saturn is in the sign after your Moon sign: the closing third of Sade Sati."},"jupiter":{"houseFromMoon":7,"favourable":true},"rahu":{"houseFromMoon":1},"sky":{"tone":"supportive","highlights":["Moon in a supportive aspect to Jupiter","Moon in a supportive aspect to Venus"],"mercuryRetrograde":false}},"reading":{"title":"A day for money and family talk","text":"Today the Moon lights up the part of your chart about money, food and family, so practical matters at home ask for your attention. The day's star is a friendly one for your birth star, which helps plans go smoothly, though your mood may need a little settling. Jupiter, the planet of your current life period, also rules today, so advice from an elder is worth hearing.","goodFor":"Sorting a bill, a family meal, a calm talk about plans","takeCare":"Impulse spending on comforts","source":"ai","language":"en"}},"today_rules":{"date":"2026-11-26","profile":{"id":"11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111","name":"Sample Person"},"day":{"date":"2026-11-26","engineVersi